  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing key drivers of radicalisation in BASULTA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to addressing the main drivers of instability in fragile communities of Basilan, Sulu, and Tawi-Tawi provinces of the Philippines, recognizing their relevance as key transit, harboring and recruitment locations for transnational violent non-state actors. Project activites will promote inclusive governance and social cohesion, prevent radicalization and strengthen referral and assistance mechanisms for fragile and recruitment-prone community members.</narrative>
  </description>
